    snakemake --use-conda -c 8 results/chi.yaml # step 0 + step 1, fully wired

step2_substrate.smk (the Fe2O3 substrate build), step2_dilute.smk/
step2_convert.smk/step2_merge.smk/step2_equilibrate.smk (the solvent+
substrate equilibration and per-species fragment insertion), and
step2_chis.smk's compute_chis all run end-to-end for both ST and MMA as
of 2026-11-14. The long pole is lmp_production itself (slab.production_ns,
10 ns/species): running on the RCCS profile (profiles/rccs/) since
2026-11-14, jobs 1996625 (ST)/1996626 (MMA), not yet complete as of
2026-11-16 -- results/chis.yaml is not yet trustworthy until that
